; Complete approved configurations. Every field is part of the admission gate.
; Fields are grouped in the same order for every entry:
;   computation type, scalar data type
;   A storage type, B storage type, C storage type or explicit absence, D storage type
;   bias storage type or explicit absence
;   scalar pointer mode
;   epilogue
;   A matrix order, B matrix order, D matrix order
;   A transpose operation, B transpose operation
;
; Accumulation and scalars use float32. Storage types are explicit per row.
; TF32 input precision has its own explicitly admitted computation variant.
; ReLU ignores the sign of zero; GELU accepts the vendor approximation.
; Activation and bias epilogues require column-major D.
; Alpha/beta values are separately proved call arguments; absent C requires beta zero.

(cublaslt-approved-configuration
  (CublasLtConfigurationOf
    (CublasLtFloat32Computation) (F32)
    (F32) (F32) (CublasLtNoCMatrixDataType) (F32)
    (CublasLtNoBiasDataType)
    (CublasLtHostScalarPointerMode)
    (CublasLtDefaultEpilogue)
    (CublasLtRowMajor) (CublasLtRowMajor) (CublasLtRowMajor)
    (CublasLtNoTranspose) (CublasLtNoTranspose)))

